<title>SOUTH AFRICA: ERPM to buy Knights' Cason dump.</title>
<headline>ERPM to buy Knights' Cason dump.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>East Rand Proprietary Mines Ltd said on Tuesday it had reached agreement to acquire the Cason sand dump from Knights Gold Mining Co Ltd for 38 million rand in cash.</p>
<p>The dump is situated some six km from the ERPM plant and contains approximately 17.1 million tonnes of material with a headgrade of 0.64 grams of gold per tonne.</p>
<p>ERPM said it was in a position to mine the dump immediately while Knights would only be able to do so in the future.</p>
<p>The deal is subject to shareholder and stock exchange approval.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
